---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '@/components/sections/SiteHeader';
import SiteFooter from '@/components/sections/SiteFooter';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from '@/config/site';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service - Kery"
  description="Terms of use for kery.dev and the Kery service."
>
  <SiteHeader />
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 py-12 [&_a]:underline [&_a]:underline-offset-4 [&_h1]:text-3xl [&_h1]:font-semibold [&_h1]:tracking-tight [&_h2]:mt-8 [&_h2]:mb-2 [&_h2]:font-semibold [&_p]:mb-3 [&_p]:leading-7">
    <div>
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Last updated: October 30, 2026</p>

      <h2>1. Agreement</h2>
      <p>
        By accessing <strong>kery.dev</strong> (“Site”), you agree to these Terms. If you do not agree, do not use the
        Site.
      </p>

      <h2>2. The Kery service</h2>
      <p>
        Your use of the Kery service is subject to these Terms and any additional terms presented when you create or use
        your account. You are responsible for the content and systems you connect to the service and for ensuring
        you have permission to connect them.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Site content</h2>
      <p>
        Marketing copy, branding, and design assets on the Site are owned by Kery and are provided for informational
        purposes. You may link to the Site; do not misrepresent affiliation or
        endorsements.
      </p>

      <h2>4. No warranty</h2>
      <p>
        THE SITE AND THE KERY SERVICE ARE PROVIDED “AS IS” WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED,
        INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, OR
        NON-INFRINGEMENT. Savings estimates are not guarantees; you remain responsible for your
        production systems and release process.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, IN NO EVENT SHALL KERY BE LIABLE FOR
        ANY INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES, OR ANY LOSS OF PROFITS, DATA, OR
        GOODWILL, ARISING OUT OF OR RELATED TO YOUR USE OF THE SITE OR THE KERY SERVICE, WHETHER BASED IN CONTRACT,
        TORT, OR ANY OTHER LEGAL THEORY, EVEN IF ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF SUCH DAMAGES.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Changes to the service</h2>
      <p>
        We may modify or suspend parts of the Kery service as the service evolves. Any paid plans, billing terms, or
        service-specific conditions will be presented in the product when applicable.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Changes</h2>
      <p>
        We may modify these Terms. The “Last updated” date will change when we do; continued use of the Site after
        changes constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Contact us at <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
</Layout>

